				<r3d:description language="eng">Welcome to the research portal of the Open Universiteit. This portal contains the publications, talks, activities and datasets of our scientific staff, and their profiles. Our research is rooted within six faculties: Educational sciences, Humanities, Law, Management, Psychology and Science. In addition to the disciplinary research programs in eight academic fields, the Open Universiteit has defined a multidisciplinary research program: Innovating for Resilience, to which all faculties contribute. This portal also functions as our institutional repository and as such it provides access to the full text files of much OU output.</r3d:description>
